## _Whats On African Drumming Classes May 27th_

Join us for another 5 weeks of fun at the end of May. NEW dates are released below for regular classes and courses in Noosa, Palmwoods and Maroochydore. Don't forget to pop in and say hi at The African Dance Co-op running on Tuesday evenings.  These nights are especially for all Rhythm Culture drumming students to practice what they have been learning in class. Dancers and members from the community are welcome and encouraged to join our African Dance Co-op!

**Palmwoods course dates @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall** African drumming course 6-7pm African dance co-op 7-8pm ($5) Dates: May 27th, June 3rd, June 10th, June 17th & June 24th **Maroochydore Course Dates @ SOLBAR** African drumming course 4.45-5.45pm Dates: May 28th, June 4th, June 11th, June 18th & June 25th **Noosa Course Dates @ The J** African Drumming course 6-7pm Dates: May 5th, May 12th, May 19th, May 26th, June 2nd, June 9th, June 16th & June 23rd **Book your 5 week course BEFORE May 27th and receive your first class FREE! $79.00 (save $21) Contact us now!**
